<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-E falls on January loss.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-E falls on January loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export SA fell 7.7 percent to 5.4 zlotys in moderate trade after the company showed a January net loss of 20,000 zlotys on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In January 1996 Elektromontaz Export made a net profit of 120,000 zlotys.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the financial results that pushed the stock down,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Some analysts said, however, that the scale of the fall fall was exaggerated by speculation.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
